bluejetty:00080002:ios.description:
Britannic 4D Simulator is a real Britannic simulator for iOS!
Take an amazing walk around the outer decks of the Britannic, the twin brother of the Titanic! This virtual tour will allow you to fully immerse yourself in the atmosphere that prevailed on this ship.
Free mods:
- All Britannic;
- Сoncept (Britannic 1914-1915);
- Night;
Paid mods:
- Driving;
- Sinking;
- Wreck

